From: Muthukumar <mk@verveflux.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Feb 2026 01:58:26 +0530
Subject: Add final batch of override hooks completing all 283 APIs (Batch 20:
 24 APIs)

Introduces new override patterns in v8_builtin_overrides.cc:

- OverridePropertyGetter: native data property getter that reads values
  from customOverrides (used for Navigator.prototype.globalPrivacyControl,
  mozConnection, webkitConnection, Error.prepareStackTrace, process.env.TZ)
- GenericOverrideOnlyCallback: function callback with no original function,
  delegates entirely to the override (used for Math.setSeed,
  HTMLFormElement.prototype.requestAutocomplete)
- WrapGetterOnPrototype: wraps an existing accessor getter via
  Object.defineProperty (used for document.fonts.size,
  speechSynthesis.onvoiceschanged, MediaQueryList.prototype.onchange,
  OfflineAudioContext.prototype.oncomplete)

Also wraps EventTarget.prototype.dispatchEvent (Pattern V),
Error.captureStackTrace for stack modification, and creates
window.mozRTCPeerConnection as a constructor alias (Pattern X).

Extends Pattern Y property existence spoofing with:
- Property addition via windowAdd/documentAdd/navigatorAdd arrays
  (for ontouchstart, ondevicelight, ondeviceproximity, etc.)
- Deletion from new prototype targets: SpeechSynthesis.prototype,
  OfflineAudioContext.prototype, MediaQueryList.prototype,
  HTMLFormElement.prototype

Full API list:
- EventTarget.prototype.dispatchEvent (Pattern V)
- Navigator.prototype.globalPrivacyControl (accessor)
- Navigator.prototype.mozConnection (accessor)
- Navigator.prototype.webkitConnection (accessor)
- Error.prepareStackTrace (accessor)
- Error.prototype.stack via captureStackTrace (Pattern V)
- document.featurePolicy.features (Pattern V)
- document.fonts.size (getter wrap)
- Math.setSeed (override-only function)
- window.mozRTCPeerConnection (Pattern X alias)
- HTMLFormElement.prototype.requestAutocomplete (override-only)
- process.env.TZ (accessor)
- speechSynthesis.onvoiceschanged (getter wrap)
- MediaQueryList.prototype.onchange (getter wrap)
- OfflineAudioContext.prototype.oncomplete (getter wrap)
- 9 event handler on* properties via Pattern Y add/remove

